\" height=\"839\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/patio-screen-4/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Durable covered patio screen enclosure designed to protect outdoor spaces from insects and weather in Florida residential homes.\"><img src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-4/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Durable covered patio screen enclosure designed to protect outdoor spaces from insects and weather in Florida residential homes.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/patio-screen-3/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom-built patio screen enclosure with pergola-style roof structure, providing shade and outdoor comfort for North and South Florida homeowners.\"><img src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-3/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Custom-built patio screen enclosure with pergola-style roof structure, providing shade and outdoor comfort for North and South Florida homeowners.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"1007\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/patio-screen-2/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-02.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Professional patio screen enclosure installation designed to improve comfort, airflow, and insect protection for Florida residential properties.\"><img src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-2/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Professional patio screen enclosure installation designed to improve comfort, airflow, and insect protection for Florida residential properties.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"839\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/patio-screen-1/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-01.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom patio screen enclosure built with durable aluminum framing, ideal for protecting outdoor living spaces in North and South Florida homes.\"><img src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-1/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-01.jpg\" alt=\"Custom patio screen enclosure built with durable aluminum framing, ideal for protecting outdoor living spaces in North and South Florida homes.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/patio-screen-7/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Flat roof patio screen enclosure designed for modern Florida homes, offering a clean architectural look and outdoor protection.\"><img src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-7/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Flat roof patio screen enclosure designed for modern Florida homes, offering a clean architectural look and outdoor protection.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"1250\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Screen Room Install <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our screen room contractors measure, custom-fabricate, and install enclosures engineered for hurricane wind compliance and durability across Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Screen Room Scope &amp; Utility Needs</h3><p>Assessment of patio dimensions, existing structure conditions, and utility requirements (electrical, HVAC). Determination of whether room will be temperature-controlled or screened-only.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Room Design &amp; Architectural Integration</h3><p>Comprehensive design showing framing layout, material selections, door placement, and integration with home architecture. 3D renderings display the complete living space transformation.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Building &amp; Utility Permits</h3><p>Permit acquisition for room construction, foundation requirements, electrical distribution (if adding climate control), and ARB submissions. Setback and coverage verification.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Construction &amp; Installation</h3><p>Full construction including framing installation, screen or glass enclosure, roofing, electrical work, and final inspections. Complete functional testing and operational walkthrough.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Professional Patio Screen Room Design &amp; Installation Services</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We install custom patio screen rooms in North &amp; South Florida using aluminum frames and fine mesh for comfort and airflow.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Sized To Your Slab</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We size every screen room to your slab, your roofline and the setbacks on your lot, then pick a frame gauge that matches the wind load at your address. In Broward that means High-Velocity Hurricane Zone framing and anchors. Mesh runs 18/14 insect screen or tighter no-see-um cloth.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Screen Room Design &amp; Installation</dt><dd>North &amp; South Florida contractors design and build custom patio screen rooms for residential comfort</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Free Design Consultation Services</dt><dd>Licensed pros offer free consultations and custom designs for patio screen room projects</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Insulated &amp; Screen Roofs</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Insulated panels sandwich a foam core between aluminum skins, holding heat off the room through an August afternoon and carrying the live load the Florida Building Code requires. When you want daylight and airflow instead, we frame a non-insulated screen roof on lighter beams and the same anchored posts.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Insulated Patio Roof Builders</dt><dd>Installers construct insulated roofs for screen rooms, providing shade and year‑round protection</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Non‑Insulated Screen Roof Installation</dt><dd>Contractors install cost‑effective, non‑insulated patio roofs that still offer bug‑free outdoor living</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Converting Porches &amp; Decks</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">An existing porch or deck becomes a screen room without new footings when the slab measures thick enough and the framing underneath carries the load. We tie the enclosure into your fascia or block wall with through-bolted anchors, then match posts, gutter line and finish color to the house.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Porch &amp; Deck Screen Room Conversion</dt><dd>Builders convert existing porches or decks into screen rooms, creating multi‑use spaces</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Structural Tie‑In &amp; Matching</dt><dd>Contractors tie screen rooms into existing structures and match the home’s architectural style</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Remodels By Licensed Crews</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">On an older enclosure we replace torn screen, add a swing door or vinyl windows, and re-anchor framing that salt air and UV have chalked. Aluminum pitted past repair gets swapped for new extrusion, and the whole job carries our Florida license and liability coverage.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Screen Room Remodeling &amp; Upgrades</dt><dd>Renovation experts add new doors, windows, and finishes to upgrade patio screen rooms for Florida homeowners</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Licensed &amp; Insured Installation</dt><dd>South Florida homeowners get peace of mind with fully licensed and insured screen room builders</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/patio-screen-8/patio-screen-enclosure-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Inside a patio screen room with a sofa and dining set\" width=\"1250\" height=\"839\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Insulated &amp; Screen Roofs\"></div></figure></div></section>";
const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-faq mm-faq--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Patio Screen Room <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about custom patio screen room installation in Florida? Our licensed contractors answer the top questions from Florida homeowners.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do screen rooms stay cool in Florida heat?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Screen room installations allow natural airflow while blocking direct sun, helping patios stay up to 15 degrees cooler in Florida heat. Aluminum frames and fine mesh screens work together to reduce solar heat gain, improve comfort, and extend the usable hours of your outdoor living space.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are screen rooms storm-rated for Florida weather?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Screen rooms are built with rust-resistant, powder-coated aluminum frames and reinforced mesh to meet Florida's hurricane and wind-load building codes. As licensed contractors, Rob and Val at Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living manage all permitting and inspections, ensuring every installation is structurally certified and code-compliant.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do screen rooms keep out mosquitoes in South Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Custom patio screen rooms use fine aluminum mesh rated to block mosquitoes, no-see-ums, and other insects common in South Florida. The mesh maintains consistent airflow while creating a comfortable, insect-free living environment. Homeowners can upgrade to pet-resistant or solar-shade mesh for additional durability and UV protection.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long do patio screen rooms last in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>High-quality aluminum-frame screen rooms last 20 to 30 years or more in Florida's coastal climate. Powder-coated frames resist rust and UV degradation, while quality mesh materials maintain integrity without frequent replacement. Routine rinsing and periodic door hardware inspections are all that's needed to preserve long-term performance.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can I fully customize my outdoor project design?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Choose from clear-view screens, pet-resistant mesh, solar-shade panels, kick plates, integrated lighting, and ceiling fans to personalize your screen room. Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living helps Florida homeowners select the right combination of features for year-round comfort, privacy, and protection in their specific climate and HOA environment.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-zonas\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-caja\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-txt\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><h2 class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Where We Serve</h2><p class=\"mm-h2\">Regional <span class=\"mm-rot\">Coverage</span> With National Vision</p></div><div class=\"mm-zonas-lista\"><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a></div><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\">View North Florida Service Areas<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></article><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">South Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in South Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered, permitted, and built for high-end residential properties.</p><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/wh